cff-version: 1.2.0
# This describes a piece of SOFTWARE, deliberately — not a study and not a
# paper. The tool is the citable artefact; the conclusions on the site are
# outputs of running it, and anyone can re-run it. See the methodology page for
# why the project is positioned this way.
type: software
# ⚠️ Questo titolo diventa il nome PERMANENTE dell'archivio Zenodo: Zenodo lo
# legge da qui al momento del tag. Diceva "CO2 and flight inefficiency", ma il
# sito non usa mai "inefficiency" in positivo -- le sue 18 occorrenze sono tutte
# negazioni. Corretto il 26/08, prima del tag.
title: "co2gap — an open pipeline for measuring the CO2 of European flights against a fuel-optimal ideal, from ADS-B trajectories"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline that reconstructs flight trajectories from open ADS-B archives and
  computes, for each flight, the CO2 actually emitted against that of an ideal
  trajectory: same aircraft type, direct great-circle route, fuel-optimal
  altitude and speed profile for the distance, and the same real wind from ERA5.
  The difference is decomposed into an additive lateral component (excess
  distance flown) and a vertical component (altitude and speed profile).
  Emissions are computed with OpenAP, with per-type correction factors anchored
  to the ICAO Carbon Emissions Calculator methodology. Results are aggregated by
  route and airport only, never per flight, aircraft or operator. Validated
  against the EUROCONTROL horizontal en-route flight efficiency indicator (KEA).
authors:
  # Entita', non persona: il progetto e' firmato co2gap e il DOI Zenodo va
  # attribuito al progetto. La forma `name:` e' l'autore-entita' di CFF.
  - name: "co2gap"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-01"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/co2gap/co2gap"
url: "https://co2gap.org"
keywords:
  - ADS-B
  - aviation emissions
  - CO2
  - flight efficiency
  - air traffic management
  - OpenAP
  - open data
references:
  - type: software
    title: "OpenAP: An open-source aircraft performance model"
    authors:
      - family-names: Sun
        given-names: Junzi
    url: "https://openap.dev"
    notes: "Aircraft performance and fuel flow model used for all emissions computation."
  - type: database
    title: "adsb.lol historical globe archive"
    notes: >-
      Flight trajectories, Open Database Licence (ODbL) v1.0.
      https://www.adsb.lol/docs/open-data/historical/
  - type: database
    title: "ERA5 hourly data on pressure levels"
    notes: >-
      Copernicus Climate Change Service (C3S) Climate Data Store.
      Wind fields used for the wind-aware baseline.
  - type: report
    title: "ICAO Carbon Emissions Calculator Methodology, version 13.1"
    notes: >-
      Appendix C fuel consumption table, used to anchor per-type reference
      cruise fuel flows.
